diff --git a/docs/macos-self-update-integration.md b/docs/macos-self-update-integration.md
index acb10b7..060b939 100644
--- a/docs/macos-self-update-integration.md
+++ b/docs/macos-self-update-integration.md
@@ -11,6 +11,27 @@ without credentials, query parameters, or a fragment before constructing the
 controller. Tests construct the real controller with `startingUpdater: false`;
 the smoke does not start a network check or install an update.
 
+The accessory host is a SwiftUI `MenuBarExtra` with no window activation path.
+Its menu exposes a persisted automatic-check toggle and user-initiated **Check
+for Updates** command. A stable/pre-release picker appears only when the host
+plist contains a valid `ReluxPreReleaseUpdateChannel`; absent metadata is a
+supported stable-only configuration, while malformed metadata fails startup
+instead of silently widening the accepted channel set. Preferences store only
+the Boolean automatic-check choice and the stable/pre-release enum value.
+
+Sparkle remains the sole production background scheduler. The injected
+scheduler seam idempotently reconciles `automaticallyChecksForUpdates`, the
+86,400-second interval, cancellation, and relaunch reconstruction on the
+retained updater; it does not create a second timer. Background update findings
+are represented in the menu and cannot ask Sparkle's standard driver for
+immediate focus. Only the explicit user command may present Sparkle UI.
+
+The presentation model maps updater callbacks to idle, checking, up-to-date,
+available, downloading, ready-to-relaunch, and failed states. Its English copy
+lives in `App/ReluxProxyMac/Resources/Localizable.xcstrings`. Errors are reduced
+to the fixed failed state, so URLs, paths, signatures, keys, tokens, and raw
+error descriptions never enter presentation state.
+
 The plist requires signed feed and pre-extraction payload verification, never
 expires signed-feed failures, disables automatic installation and profiling,
 and enables only Sparkle's Installer launcher service. The sandboxed host keeps
@@ -25,6 +46,18 @@ Run the deterministic credential-free build and lifecycle smoke with:
 make sparkle-integration-validate
 ```
 
+Run the focused settings and lifecycle suite without starting the updater,
+installing an update, or activating the provider/VPN:
+
+```bash
+xcodebuild test \
+  -workspace ReluxTunnel.xcworkspace \
+  -scheme ReluxProxyMac \
+  -destination 'platform=macOS' \
+  -only-testing:ReluxProxyMacTests \
+  CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO
+```
+
 The gate performs an unsigned Release build, checks the resolved dependency,
 embedded framework/helper layout, plist, license, linkage, target boundary,
 entitlements, and Release build settings, then ad-hoc signs the built host and

codex
